TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells 10 shifts, exchange in all cells

SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -print_cells 1
    -punch_cells 1

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected_transport.txt
    -reset false

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell sc_uS_cm
    10 PUNCH STEP_NO, CELL_NO, SC

PRINT
    -selected_output true
END
